WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.110
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.380 --> 00:07.100
[The content, events, techniques, and outcomes of massage depicted in this series]

3
00:07.210 --> 00:08.211
[are entirely fictional and intended for entertainment purposes only.]

4
00:08.240 --> 00:09.421
[They should not be used as medical advice or as a reference for traditional Thai massage.]

5
00:09.500 --> 00:10.901
[Viewer discretion is advised. Do not attempt to imitate any of the techniques shown,]

6
00:11.000 --> 00:12.001
[as doing so may result in injury.]

7
00:12.030 --> 00:13.161
[Massage services should only be provided by practitioners]

8
00:13.170 --> 00:14.900
[who are legally licensed and registered.]

9
00:15.000 --> 00:16.320
Not one of them is any good.

10
00:16.406 --> 00:17.560
Bring me someone else.

11
00:17.607 --> 00:20.100
I know a younger therapist at the massage shop where I used to work.

12
00:20.120 --> 00:21.360
She’s an excellent masseuse.

13
00:21.387 --> 00:22.388
- I don't think so. - Call her in.

14
00:22.587 --> 00:24.400
You mean Dongyang?

15
00:24.630 --> 00:27.440
Yes. He asked me to give him a Kasai massage. His little bird wouldn’t sing.

16
00:27.611 --> 00:29.360
Areeya recommended this therapist.

17
00:30.050 --> 00:32.051
The one you once lectured.

18
00:32.176 --> 00:33.280
She has great hands

19
00:34.246 --> 00:35.247
even better than yours.

20
00:35.307 --> 00:37.520
You remind me of another therapist.

21
00:37.600 --> 00:39.601
- Who was it? - That therapist is fucking dead.

22
00:42.243 --> 00:44.600
Ittha, Pingkhala,

23
00:44.960 --> 00:47.480
Sumana, Kalathari,

24
00:47.560 --> 00:49.720
Sahatsarangsi,

25
00:49.800 --> 00:52.320
Thawari, Chanthaphusang.

26
00:53.075 --> 00:54.076
Hey!

27
00:59.139 --> 01:00.140
Are you one of them?

28
02:32.715 --> 02:35.320
How did you know that someone was trying to kill me?

29
02:35.830 --> 02:36.831
I didn't know.

30
02:37.600 --> 02:40.246
How the hell do you not know? Where is your brain?

31
02:40.375 --> 02:42.376
Didn't you even ask when they sent you here?

32
02:42.790 --> 02:44.400
I'm just glad you're safe.

33
02:46.384 --> 02:47.385
You're Phat, right?

34
02:48.240 --> 02:49.241
Yes, sir.

35
02:49.640 --> 02:52.500
Thanks for getting here just in time.

36
02:53.515 --> 02:55.840
They'd better hope I don't find out who they're working for.

37
03:09.894 --> 03:12.368
Who sent you? Tell me right now.

38
03:12.464 --> 03:13.840
Or I'll shoot you right here.

39
03:13.878 --> 03:16.200
Easy, Dongyang.

40
03:16.879 --> 03:19.723
No assassin would go through massage training just to kill someone.

41
03:21.526 --> 03:23.075
And she's damn good at it, too.

42
03:27.179 --> 03:29.040
Who sent you to kill me?

43
03:29.478 --> 03:31.880
Who sent you?

44
03:32.987 --> 03:35.880
She just... she was only contacted to give you a massage for your condition.

45
03:44.648 --> 03:45.649
Phat.

46
03:46.208 --> 03:47.209
Take her to the hospital.

47
03:47.531 --> 03:48.920
Then take her home.

48
03:49.560 --> 03:50.561
Yes, sir.

49
04:12.230 --> 04:14.550
Ms. Hattha, your prescription is ready.

50
04:19.000 --> 04:20.500
Ms. Hattha, what's your last name?

51
04:20.560 --> 04:21.661
Niphakornkul.

52
04:21.755 --> 04:24.360
- Are you allergic to any medications? - Nope.

53
04:24.923 --> 04:26.267
This is an antibiotic.

54
04:26.300 --> 04:29.280
Take one tablet after each meal until it's finished.

55
04:29.350 --> 04:30.631
And this is a painkiller.

56
04:30.651 --> 04:33.650
If you're in pain, you can take it after meals as well.

57
04:33.700 --> 04:35.960
But if you have an allergic reaction to either medication

58
04:36.001 --> 04:38.922
or your condition doesn't improve,

59
04:38.940 --> 04:40.680
please come back and see the doctor right away.

60
04:42.366 --> 04:43.367
That's everything.

61
04:53.579 --> 04:54.580
Where do you live?

62
04:55.960 --> 04:56.961
I can get home by myself.

63
05:17.299 --> 05:19.200
I was told to take you home.

64
05:22.430 --> 05:24.240
He can order you around, but he can't order me around.

65
05:26.220 --> 05:28.160
Ow! It hurts!

66
05:33.500 --> 05:34.501
Hey!

67
05:35.110 --> 05:36.160
Stay still.

68
05:39.486 --> 05:40.680
Hey! Hey!

69
05:51.862 --> 05:52.863
Where do you live?

70
06:02.344 --> 06:03.400
So where do you live?

71
06:10.598 --> 06:11.800
Then stay at my place tonight.

72
06:12.500 --> 06:13.501
Talat Phlu.

73
06:51.501 --> 06:53.784
Hey! What happened?

74
06:57.000 --> 06:58.001
You...

75
07:02.288 --> 07:04.068
Come on. Get inside. Go.

76
07:17.289 --> 07:20.120
[Hattha's House]

77
07:47.710 --> 07:48.880
What the fuck?

78
08:19.838 --> 08:21.100
Did everything go smoothly today?

79
08:34.592 --> 08:36.700
Yes. Mr. Dongyang is safe.

80
08:39.259 --> 08:41.160
Get ready to become Dongyang's bodyguard.

81
08:41.414 --> 08:42.415
Keep an eye on him.

82
08:51.598 --> 08:53.480
Yes, Dad.

83
08:57.211 --> 08:59.650
Don't let anyone find out who you are.

84
09:16.070 --> 09:17.071
Phat!

85
09:17.718 --> 09:20.070
Get to the hospital and check on your mom right now!

86
09:20.246 --> 09:21.247
Hurry up!

87
09:38.432 --> 09:39.440
Phat, come here.

88
09:42.256 --> 09:44.200
Mom! Mom!

89
09:45.190 --> 09:46.191
Mom!

90
09:46.640 --> 09:49.180
I'm so sorry. Don't leave me.

91
09:49.408 --> 09:50.409
Mom!

92
09:50.470 --> 09:52.760
- Mom! - My son, Patrick.

93
09:53.886 --> 09:55.040
Stay with Dad.

94
09:55.923 --> 09:57.800
Listen to him, please.

95
10:00.467 --> 10:01.468
I love you.

96
10:01.580 --> 10:02.760
I love you too, Mom.

97
10:02.850 --> 10:03.851
I'm so sorry.

98
10:04.147 --> 10:05.148
Love you, Mom.

99
10:05.150 --> 10:07.280
Mom! Mom!

100
10:07.987 --> 10:09.320
Mom!

101
10:12.504 --> 10:14.680
Mom! Mom!

102
10:14.947 --> 10:16.500
No.

103
10:34.251 --> 10:35.280
What about Dad?

104
10:35.904 --> 10:38.600
Just come upstairs. Don't be stubborn.

105
10:39.712 --> 10:40.960
Stay here with us.

106
10:41.371 --> 10:43.400
Be good, so Dad will love you.

107
11:39.624 --> 11:40.625
Wan.

108
11:41.475 --> 11:43.440
I'm sorry. I'll be more careful next time.

109
11:43.476 --> 11:45.120
I'll take better care of myself.

110
11:46.040 --> 11:48.141
But the doctor said it's not that serious.

111
11:48.702 --> 11:51.640
The wound isn't that deep. I'm tough, you know.

112
11:54.350 --> 11:55.840
Isn't there any other way?

113
12:00.094 --> 12:01.360
This is the only way.

114
12:03.976 --> 12:05.500
Get close, then disappear without a trace.

115
12:07.782 --> 12:09.080
I'm gonna get him back.

116
12:09.500 --> 12:11.801
You give him a relaxing massage while you're the one getting hurt.

117
12:13.347 --> 12:14.966
These things take time.

118
12:23.526 --> 12:25.280
Damn, I can pee so easily now.

119
12:28.064 --> 12:29.440
Damn, she's really good at massages.

120
12:34.198 --> 12:35.840
I've already treated some of his symptoms with massage.

121
12:36.920 --> 12:38.160
And I drugged him, too.

122
12:38.221 --> 12:40.040
He'll probably call me back for another massage soon.

123
12:41.160 --> 12:42.880
Drugged him?

124
12:44.798 --> 12:45.800
You bastard!

125
12:58.452 --> 13:00.040
Give me a hand.

126
13:06.275 --> 13:07.720
Did you hit a nerve again?

127
13:10.827 --> 13:13.160
I'll kill him before he even realizes what's happening.

128
13:31.763 --> 13:33.860
- She uses the Kamdon pressure point. - [The Kamdon point is used in massage to relieve neck pain and headaches.]

129
13:33.992 --> 13:35.438
- [It's located in the hollow beneath the base of the skull.] - It's a key pressure point

130
13:35.742 --> 13:37.960
that can affect the blood vessels in the neck.

131
13:41.763 --> 13:43.480
That's a dangerous pressure point, isn't it?

132
13:45.379 --> 13:49.680
What does that have to do with the Kasai massage, Master?

133
13:50.384 --> 13:51.385
Come here.

134
13:54.854 --> 13:55.855
Master.

135
13:56.550 --> 13:58.640
[WARNING: The massage techniques depicted in this series are entirely fictional.]

136
13:58.651 --> 14:00.652
- [Do not attempt to imitate them.] - Master?

137
14:00.907 --> 14:01.908
I'm sorry.

138
14:03.739 --> 14:05.990
I barely pressed it and you couldn't even take the pain.

139
14:07.560 --> 14:09.640
So why would that girl press that point on Dongyang?

140
14:11.336 --> 14:12.480
Why would she do it?

141
14:14.178 --> 14:15.321
Why?

142
14:29.300 --> 14:30.301
What?

143
14:51.558 --> 14:52.646
Work on the piriformis muscle, too.

144
15:11.283 --> 15:13.320
I fell down the stairs, so my legs've been acting up.

145
15:13.411 --> 15:14.640
Your legs acted up first.

146
15:15.412 --> 15:16.700
That's what made you fall down the stairs.

147
15:19.568 --> 15:21.320
That masseur drugged you.

148
15:22.902 --> 15:23.903
Try moving it.

149
15:27.603 --> 15:28.800
Damn, that's good.

150
15:31.185 --> 15:32.186
That bitch!

151
15:32.731 --> 15:34.262
I should've killed her.

152
15:34.955 --> 15:37.270
She wasn't trying to seriously hurt you.

153
15:37.744 --> 15:38.960
She's just keeping you from fully recovering

154
15:39.200 --> 15:40.500
so you'll call her back for another massage.

155
15:40.614 --> 15:42.130
What kind of fucking therapist keeps her customers sick?

156
15:42.864 --> 15:45.120
Muk, tell that fucking therapist

157
15:45.220 --> 15:47.328
to come massage me again in three days.

158
16:43.067 --> 16:44.068
Dad.

159
16:52.739 --> 16:53.960
What are we doing?

160
16:56.600 --> 16:58.120
I fought them before,

161
16:58.792 --> 17:00.792
and it cost us your mother and your brother.

162
17:02.787 --> 17:05.854
How can people like us fight them?

163
17:08.200 --> 17:09.201
Exactly.

164
17:10.501 --> 17:12.220
What can we possibly do with just our bare hands?

165
17:18.374 --> 17:19.375
Uncle.

166
17:19.526 --> 17:21.400
Where's Dad, Wan?

167
17:22.144 --> 17:23.145
Dad.

168
17:28.056 --> 17:29.057
Minkheng and Wan.

169
17:29.230 --> 17:30.231
- Yes? - Search everywhere.

170
17:31.592 --> 17:32.593
What are you looking for?

171
17:32.750 --> 17:33.751
Excuse me.

172
17:38.040 --> 17:39.041
Dad, what are you looking for?

173
17:40.680 --> 17:42.681
- Find anything, Minkheng? - Not yet.

174
17:42.840 --> 17:44.200
I'm asking what you're looking for.

175
17:51.179 --> 17:52.180
Dad, what are you looking for?

176
17:55.552 --> 17:56.553
Push the cabinet.

177
18:18.414 --> 18:20.206
They think our whole family is dead.

178
18:21.710 --> 18:24.387
That the only one left is a harmless little girl.

179
18:24.915 --> 18:27.000
If they find out you're planning to take revenge,

180
18:27.558 --> 18:29.059
they'll never let us live.

181
18:30.059 --> 18:31.560
We can't fight them.

182
18:32.006 --> 18:33.782
Can't we fight them, or are we just refusing to fight?

183
18:35.936 --> 18:39.291
I'm not refusing to fight because I'm scared.

184
18:40.437 --> 18:41.680
And I didn't run away

185
18:43.347 --> 18:45.022
because I'm a coward.

186
18:46.632 --> 18:48.440
I just can't lose another child.

187
18:49.187 --> 18:51.406
Dad, don't ever forget that they killed Mom and Phak

188
18:51.480 --> 18:52.720
and left you like this.

189
18:53.246 --> 18:55.320
And it's because I am still like that.

190
18:56.638 --> 18:57.795
And you're just a woman.

191
18:59.256 --> 19:00.360
What can we possibly do against them?

192
19:06.531 --> 19:07.532
Hattha.

193
19:08.158 --> 19:09.159
Hattha.

194
19:35.059 --> 19:36.060
He's dead.

195
19:36.611 --> 19:38.680
- Korn, you lied to me. - Hey! What are you doing?

196
19:38.702 --> 19:40.440
- Tim, let him go. - You know how to kill someone with massage, right?

197
19:40.503 --> 19:41.760
- Right? Korn? - Let go!

198
19:41.822 --> 19:44.400
- Tim, calm down. - I told you I just got here.

199
19:44.423 --> 19:45.680
I don't know what to do so you'd believe me.

200
19:47.500 --> 19:49.090
[WARNING: The massage techniques depicted in this series are entirely fictional.]

201
19:49.100 --> 19:50.720
[Do not attempt to imitate them.]

202
19:56.750 --> 19:57.751
We should hide here.

203
19:58.880 --> 19:59.881
Korn!

204
20:08.166 --> 20:10.240
Korn! Inn!

205
20:10.710 --> 20:12.123
About that killer massage manual...

206
20:13.019 --> 20:14.520
I believe you now. It doesn't exist.

207
20:15.131 --> 20:16.320
I'm serious.

208
20:17.195 --> 20:18.600
You two are my family.

209
20:19.824 --> 20:21.739
Of course you're more important to me than some stupid manual.

210
20:23.200 --> 20:24.832
You two are running away from me, aren't you?

211
20:26.384 --> 20:29.302
Fine. Then keep running forever.

212
20:31.051 --> 20:32.152
You'd better hope I never find you.

213
20:44.947 --> 20:46.300
Uncle! Uncle!

214
20:46.958 --> 20:47.959
Uncle!

215
20:51.400 --> 20:52.401
Why?

216
20:53.155 --> 20:54.760
Why did this happen?

217
20:55.240 --> 20:56.280
Why?

218
21:10.942 --> 21:13.040
Why did you let that girl massage him again, Master?

219
21:13.830 --> 21:15.760
You saw that he hurt Mr. Dongyang.

220
21:19.174 --> 21:21.067
Do you know why Dongyang fell down the stairs?

221
21:22.280 --> 21:24.281
You think that girl did it on purpose, Master?

222
21:28.480 --> 21:30.481
[WARNING: The massage techniques depicted in this series are entirely fictional.]

223
21:30.500 --> 21:32.501
[Do not attempt to imitate them.]

224
21:39.350 --> 21:40.360
The same pressure point

225
21:41.152 --> 21:43.160
can be used for healing or can be dangerous.

226
21:43.654 --> 21:45.440
It all depends on whether the masseur is skilled enough.

227
21:46.187 --> 21:47.360
And you definitely aren't.

228
21:51.136 --> 21:52.160
Go to the room.

229
21:58.704 --> 22:00.320
I'm on my period today.

230
22:13.710 --> 22:14.920
I need you to help me with something.

231
22:32.480 --> 22:33.481
[Wan]

232
22:52.656 --> 22:53.657
A cramp?

233
22:54.854 --> 22:55.855
I'm fine now.

234
22:56.528 --> 22:57.729
But your head still feels heavy, right?

235
22:59.734 --> 23:01.936
When you get a cramp, your whole body tenses up.

236
23:02.459 --> 23:03.800
The pressure rises to your head.

237
23:06.840 --> 23:07.841
I'll release it for you.

238
23:08.142 --> 23:09.454
What else do you want from me?

239
23:10.035 --> 23:11.036
Stay.

240
23:11.256 --> 23:12.257
Just sit still.

241
23:53.875 --> 23:54.876
Feel better?

242
24:23.240 --> 24:24.920
How well do you know Dongyang?

243
24:28.600 --> 24:29.601
I don't know him.

244
24:30.864 --> 24:32.200
I was just following orders.

245
24:33.136 --> 24:34.137
Whose orders?

246
24:36.267 --> 24:37.320
What are you planning to do now?

247
24:39.350 --> 24:40.351
I was just asking.

248
24:42.347 --> 24:43.348
Fine, I won't ask.

249
24:44.411 --> 24:45.412
But keep massaging me.

250
24:46.296 --> 24:47.297
I'll pay you.

251
24:47.560 --> 24:48.561
I'm expensive.

252
24:50.510 --> 24:51.700
And I don't take money.

253
24:52.675 --> 24:55.118
Anything. If it's something I can give you.

254
24:59.339 --> 25:00.340
Mm.

255
25:08.630 --> 25:09.720
You're stressed, aren't you?

256
25:14.880 --> 25:16.440
Sometimes you need to let things go.

257
25:17.176 --> 25:19.920
It'll help loosen up these tight muscles a little.

258
25:30.611 --> 25:32.400
Sometimes you have to let yourself make mistakes.

259
25:34.963 --> 25:36.500
It's exhausting trying to be good all the time.

260
26:04.862 --> 26:05.863
Where are you headed?

261
26:06.398 --> 26:08.560
Oh, we're going to the orchard in Rayong, sir.

262
26:10.500 --> 26:11.501
Here you go.

263
26:19.712 --> 26:21.100
- Go ahead. - Yes, sir.

264
26:21.195 --> 26:22.196
- Go. - Wait.

265
26:23.200 --> 26:24.201
Wait, Sergeant.

266
26:26.176 --> 26:28.200
Captain, there's a sticker.

267
26:35.822 --> 26:36.823
We'll need to search the vehicle.

268
26:37.416 --> 26:38.417
Step out of the truck.

269
26:39.160 --> 26:40.161
Get out.

270
26:42.131 --> 26:43.132
Open it. Hurry.

271
26:49.304 --> 26:50.480
Hey, what's that sound?

272
26:51.305 --> 26:53.400
- What's the sound? - Hey! Run!

273
26:53.480 --> 26:55.120
Hey! Follow them!

274
26:55.251 --> 26:56.700
Search the truck, now.

275
27:03.430 --> 27:04.431
What?

276
27:04.992 --> 27:06.800
Sir? There are people.

277
27:07.195 --> 27:09.300
- Help them! - Okay.

278
27:10.443 --> 27:11.680
Calm down, just calm down.

279
27:14.182 --> 27:18.091
I told you, it's your job to take care of this for me.

280
27:18.867 --> 27:20.800
I've already paid you a fortune.

281
27:22.846 --> 27:24.500
Yeah, I'm holding it over you.

282
27:25.067 --> 27:27.368
Everyone in this damn country can be bought.

283
27:27.456 --> 27:28.840
You're not the only one.

284
27:31.184 --> 27:33.843
We believe that high-ranking government officials

285
27:34.766 --> 27:37.080
are working with this foreign criminal syndicate.

286
27:37.347 --> 27:39.920
No matter who's involved,

287
27:41.250 --> 27:43.440
I'll make sure they're all brought to justice.

288
27:43.880 --> 27:46.320
I'll root out this entire illicit operation

289
27:47.120 --> 27:50.115
to restore the honor of Thai civil servants.

290
27:50.264 --> 27:53.060
Root out my ass.

291
27:53.515 --> 27:55.920
What fucking honor? What a load of bullshit.

292
27:57.504 --> 28:01.800
Set up a meeting with Desmond and Xing out at sea this Friday.

293
28:02.560 --> 28:05.720
I'll settle everything with both of them at once and get this shit over with.

294
28:06.504 --> 28:07.505
Sure, Boss.

295
28:10.800 --> 28:11.801
Fuck!

296
28:42.059 --> 28:43.060
I'm leaving.

297
28:43.243 --> 28:44.760
You're just getting better.

298
28:45.547 --> 28:46.760
I think you should skip it this month.

299
28:47.131 --> 28:48.520
I can call Luang Por and let him know.

300
28:48.816 --> 28:50.817
People are waiting for you to treat them. You can't just leave them waiting.

301
29:00.158 --> 29:01.159
Where are you going, Dad?

302
29:01.659 --> 29:03.500
Aren't you going to give massages to the elderly at the temple?

303
29:05.291 --> 29:06.292
I'm coming with you.

304
29:14.480 --> 29:15.840
Come on. Let's go.

305
29:16.500 --> 29:17.501
Go.

306
29:42.700 --> 29:45.800
Ya, you don't have to go to the temple today. I'll go instead.

307
29:47.960 --> 29:50.480
What? Don't you have somewhere else to be?

308
29:51.080 --> 29:52.181
Not anymore.

309
29:59.280 --> 30:02.840
[Free Thai Massage for Health by Volunteer Massage Therapists]

310
30:40.040 --> 30:41.400
That's Hattha.

311
30:41.798 --> 30:44.192
She comes to treat the elderly here every month.

312
30:44.294 --> 30:46.800
She's been doing it for years, since before she even graduated.

313
30:47.179 --> 30:49.180
Her father's here to help so it's even better.

314
30:49.675 --> 30:51.760
Otherwise, she'd be here until evening.

315
30:51.904 --> 30:53.500
Sometimes it gets dark before she's done.

316
30:54.805 --> 30:56.176
The man in the wheelchair?

317
30:56.864 --> 30:59.120
Don't let that fool you. He's a great masseur.

318
30:59.480 --> 31:02.480
He used to run a massage shop in Phuket years ago.

319
31:03.086 --> 31:04.587
Does her father live in Phuket?

320
31:05.087 --> 31:06.435
Not anymore.

321
31:06.880 --> 31:08.681
But he comes by every once in a while.

322
31:15.675 --> 31:17.520
This is my dad's shop. You can go there.

323
31:29.160 --> 31:33.120
[Phuket Massage Shop Fire in 2011]

324
31:36.000 --> 31:38.001
[Deadly Phuket Fire Guts Famous 'Our Home' Massage Shop]

325
31:38.050 --> 31:40.151
[Tragedy: One Dead, One Missing, One Miraculous Survivor]

326
31:54.840 --> 31:56.000
[Master Tim: How's it going?]

327
32:14.707 --> 32:16.120
Nothing suspicious, sir.

328
32:54.627 --> 32:55.628
Hey.

329
32:56.179 --> 32:57.400
It's your first day, too?

330
32:57.800 --> 32:58.801
I'm Boat.

331
32:59.246 --> 33:00.247
Phat.

332
33:03.800 --> 33:04.801
Let's go.

333
33:06.801 --> 33:07.850
This bitch tried to run, Boss.

334
33:10.800 --> 33:12.401
I'm scared. I won't run again.

335
33:49.654 --> 33:51.900
You don't die just from losing an arm.

336
33:51.920 --> 33:53.760
Trust me, I know this stuff.

337
33:54.435 --> 33:57.520
You gotta keep hacking at her until she dies.

338
34:21.310 --> 34:24.600
Boss! Boss, she's dead.

339
34:32.300 --> 34:33.301
Good.

340
34:34.565 --> 34:36.100
The last guard couldn't stomach it.

341
34:36.491 --> 34:37.900
He killed the woman before I was done.

342
34:38.651 --> 34:39.800
So I shot the bastard.

343
34:41.300 --> 34:43.401
Fucking idiot, trying to play hero.

344
34:57.062 --> 34:58.063
Did you find it, Inn?

345
35:02.000 --> 35:04.101
It's okay. Thanks a lot.

346
35:25.600 --> 35:27.301
Let's go, Uncle. It's late.

347
35:28.566 --> 35:29.567
Minkheng.

348
35:31.267 --> 35:33.600
Has Hattha ever gone through any of my storage boxes?

349
35:35.611 --> 35:36.612
No, I don't think so.

350
35:37.675 --> 35:39.600
Oh, actually, there was one time.

351
35:39.867 --> 35:42.566
It was not long after you moved to Photharam.

352
35:42.896 --> 35:46.640
She asked me for the key so she could look for a herbal compress recipe.

353
35:50.067 --> 35:51.440
Please don't let it be what I think it is.

354
35:59.100 --> 36:00.101
[Massage Dongyang – 9:00 AM]

355
36:00.150 --> 36:04.151
[Saturday, August 29, 2026, 9:00–10:00 AM]

356
36:31.960 --> 36:33.061
[DO NOT READ]

357
36:40.400 --> 36:42.501
You're going to die by my hand, Dongyang.

358
37:07.800 --> 37:09.601
Wan, she's left.

359
37:10.200 --> 37:11.201
Yes, Uncle.

360
37:12.300 --> 37:13.441
Thank you.

361
37:16.001 --> 37:17.002
Let's go.

362
37:50.800 --> 37:51.801
Where's Mr. Dongyang?

363
37:52.400 --> 37:53.640
He wanted you to wait here.

364
37:55.200 --> 37:56.201
Wait, wait.

365
37:56.941 --> 37:58.400
Hey—oh.

366
38:02.200 --> 38:03.201
What the hell?

367
38:11.480 --> 38:12.481
[Wan]

368
38:22.763 --> 38:23.920
She's not answering, Uncle.

369
38:24.923 --> 38:26.600
But the GPS says she's in this building.

370
38:28.112 --> 38:30.100
Uncle, I'll go down and check.

371
38:30.235 --> 38:31.236
Wait here, okay?

372
38:31.862 --> 38:34.750
Minkheng, keep an eye on him. Call me if anything happens.

373
39:30.784 --> 39:32.500
May I see your VIP membership card, please?

374
39:38.844 --> 39:40.120
He's a regular of mine.

375
39:41.692 --> 39:42.693
Muk.

376
39:49.440 --> 39:50.720
What are you doing here?

377
39:51.600 --> 39:52.601
I'm lost.

378
39:59.483 --> 40:00.840
You think I'm lying.

379
40:02.155 --> 40:03.156
I can smell it.

380
40:03.984 --> 40:05.000
The smell again?

381
40:06.614 --> 40:08.240
Hey, wait. Hold on.

382
40:10.571 --> 40:12.572
And you're afraid of something, too.

383
40:16.187 --> 40:18.123
My senses are more acute than most people's.

384
40:20.112 --> 40:21.300
My sense of smell, I mean.

385
40:23.142 --> 40:24.176
You're stressed.

386
40:25.100 --> 40:26.701
And you probably don't believe what I'm telling you.

387
40:28.512 --> 40:30.300
What exactly do you want here?

388
40:34.054 --> 40:35.155
You smell nice.

389
40:37.339 --> 40:39.640
That means deep down, you're a good person.

390
40:41.942 --> 40:44.560
I want you to believe that I have no intention of hurting anyone.

391
40:46.035 --> 40:47.440
Especially a good person like you.

392
41:04.036 --> 41:05.037
After you.

393
41:08.571 --> 41:09.572
Hurry.

394
41:09.584 --> 41:10.600
- What? - Come on.

395
41:18.585 --> 41:19.586
Where are we going?

396
41:22.520 --> 41:25.352
Oh, aren't I massaging Mr. Dongyang here?

397
41:26.300 --> 41:27.880
Good luck, okay?

398
41:28.440 --> 41:29.441
I'll handle it.

399
41:37.000 --> 41:39.261
Uncle, that's her.

400
41:42.595 --> 41:43.600
Call Wan. Quick.

401
41:44.766 --> 41:45.767
Okay.

402
41:49.654 --> 41:51.120
This is your father's massage shop, isn't it?

403
41:57.406 --> 41:59.520
Don't worry. Dongyang doesn't know.

404
42:00.424 --> 42:01.425
Is it or isn't it?

405
42:08.846 --> 42:10.847
This place is more dangerous than you think.

406
42:16.910 --> 42:17.911
Has he picked up yet?

407
42:18.264 --> 42:19.265
No.

408
42:26.800 --> 42:28.180
Get in the van. Mr. Dongyang is waiting.

409
42:29.310 --> 42:31.440
- Come on, just get in. - Go.

410
42:32.883 --> 42:34.000
- You need to sit in the front. - Okay.

411
42:42.104 --> 42:43.105
Uncle?

412
42:50.411 --> 42:53.300
- Wan, they grabbed her and took her away in a van. - Got it.

413
42:54.700 --> 42:55.701
Hurry up and follow them.

414
43:17.160 --> 43:18.500
Do you usually offer special sessions?

415
43:43.440 --> 43:44.441
The motorway?

416
43:45.611 --> 43:46.840
Where are they taking her?

417
44:05.062 --> 44:06.063
Get out.

418
44:07.323 --> 44:08.324
Hurry.

419
44:11.368 --> 44:12.369
Go.

420
44:33.827 --> 44:35.080
Let's go around the back, Uncle.

421
44:35.768 --> 44:36.769
Go.

422
44:46.496 --> 44:47.560
Mr. Dongyang told you to wait here.

423
44:48.968 --> 44:50.169
Then where is Mr. Dongyang?

424
44:50.640 --> 44:51.720
He has some business to take care of.

425
44:52.400 --> 44:55.200
When he's ready, he'll send someone to pick you up.

426
44:57.246 --> 44:59.447
Hey, go wait at the boat.

427
45:23.160 --> 45:24.161
Minkheng.

428
45:24.190 --> 45:26.091
Wait here. Call me if anything happens.

429
45:26.840 --> 45:27.841
I'll be right back.

430
45:28.203 --> 45:29.700
- Be careful. - Okay.

431
45:36.827 --> 45:38.120
Uncle?

432
45:38.395 --> 45:40.160
I think I forgot my phone in the car.

433
45:40.483 --> 45:42.240
Go get it and hurry back.

434
45:42.310 --> 45:43.311
Okay.

435
45:46.046 --> 45:47.640
That asshole causing trouble again?

436
45:51.198 --> 45:52.960
Yeah. I'm on my way to see him.

437
45:54.046 --> 45:55.720
- Dongyang? - If he can't do anything about it,

438
45:55.800 --> 45:56.920
I will ask someone else.

439
45:57.272 --> 45:58.273
Okay?

440
46:01.500 --> 46:02.501
I'm sorry.

441
46:05.201 --> 46:06.750
Yeah, don't worry.

442
46:07.221 --> 46:08.700
I've called everyone in this time.

443
46:09.275 --> 46:10.640
Desmond and Xing will both be there.

444
46:15.614 --> 46:16.615
Huh?

445
46:37.480 --> 46:38.481
Hey!

446
46:39.992 --> 46:41.960
You! Stop!

447
46:49.688 --> 46:50.689
You bastard.

448
48:20.467 --> 48:22.739
Yeah, I'm here.

449
48:23.432 --> 48:25.000
I'm on my way. Yeah.

450
48:54.680 --> 48:56.681
[Mr. Dongyang]

451
48:59.803 --> 49:00.804
Yes, Mr. Dongyang?

452
49:02.150 --> 49:03.400
Only the hostesses are going on the boat?

453
49:04.787 --> 49:05.788
Yes, sir. Got it.

454
49:07.520 --> 49:08.721
Can I go massage Mr. Dongyang now?

455
49:10.100 --> 49:12.640
He only asked for the hostesses, not you.

456
49:12.951 --> 49:14.760
Mr. Dongyang's in a really bad mood.

457
49:15.261 --> 49:16.520
I don't think you'll be giving him a massage today.

458
49:17.100 --> 49:18.720
Looks like you came all this way for nothing.

459
49:23.856 --> 49:26.838
Hey, tell the girls to get dressed and take them to the boat.

460
49:27.200 --> 49:29.101
Mr. Dongyang's really pissed off.

461
49:30.100 --> 49:31.101
Hurry up.

462
49:31.928 --> 49:32.929
Yeah.

463
49:35.422 --> 49:36.423
Hey!

464
49:37.790 --> 49:38.791
Where are you going?

465
49:38.990 --> 49:39.991
The bathroom.

466
49:50.774 --> 49:52.600
You're following me this closely. Wanna come into the bathroom with me too?

467
50:11.270 --> 50:12.271
Mr. Krit?

468
50:15.627 --> 50:17.718
Hello, Mr. Krit.

469
50:18.360 --> 50:20.440
I'm Hattha. Do you remember me?

470
50:21.936 --> 50:22.937
Hattha?

471
50:23.307 --> 50:26.728
My parents owned a massage shop called Our Home Thai Massage.

472
50:28.107 --> 50:30.720
Ah, the one in Phuket, right?

473
50:31.208 --> 50:32.209
Yes.

474
50:33.109 --> 50:35.320
I've seen you in the news.

475
50:35.718 --> 50:36.760
How have you been?

476
50:36.982 --> 50:37.983
I've been well.

477
50:39.390 --> 50:41.520
What brings you here? Are you here for fun?

478
50:41.710 --> 50:44.720
Oh, I'm a massage therapist. I'm waiting for a client.

479
50:45.704 --> 50:47.100
What brings you here, sir?

480
50:47.400 --> 50:49.880
I'm here to meet some important people.

481
50:50.558 --> 50:52.680
Politics. It's boring.

482
50:54.174 --> 50:58.254
What about you? Who are you living with these days?

483
50:58.952 --> 51:02.280
I'm staying with Wan, Dr. Inn's son.

484
51:03.214 --> 51:06.160
Ah. Give them my regards.

485
51:06.574 --> 51:10.870
It's good that you became a massage therapist like your father.

486
51:12.486 --> 51:14.432
If your father were still here, he'd be proud of you.

487
51:16.283 --> 51:18.884
I should get going now.

488
51:18.984 --> 51:20.720
Of course. Goodbye.

489
52:08.300 --> 52:10.101
- Hello? - How was it?

490
52:10.862 --> 52:12.320
I just walked her to the bathroom.

491
52:12.663 --> 52:13.664
How are things over there?

492
52:14.227 --> 52:15.228
Everyone's here.

493
52:15.710 --> 52:17.600
Once Mr. Dongyang gets here, we can set sail.

494
52:18.531 --> 52:20.480
- Send me updates. - Sure.

495
52:38.902 --> 52:41.320
Yeah, I'm at the bathroom. Let me check.

496
52:44.598 --> 52:45.599
Shit.

497
52:45.776 --> 52:48.320
I really got my period. I'm screwed.

498
52:48.502 --> 52:50.640
What if I get on the boat and he wants me? What am I gonna do?

499
52:51.360 --> 52:54.326
Dongyang's fucking crazy. I'm not risking it.

500
52:54.912 --> 52:57.300
What if he throws me overboard like Ning?

501
52:58.128 --> 52:59.440
Li, are you in Pattaya?

502
53:00.576 --> 53:01.800
There's seriously no one available?

503
53:02.726 --> 53:05.632
Yeah. If I can't find a replacement for tonight,

504
53:06.016 --> 53:07.320
we're all totally screwed.

505
53:08.432 --> 53:09.960
Can you find someone for me?

506
53:10.645 --> 53:13.200
I need her here right now. I'll pay extra.

507
53:35.200 --> 53:36.700
Are you looking for someone to take your place on the boat?

508
53:37.248 --> 53:38.760
I can take your place. I won't even charge you.

509
53:39.675 --> 53:41.000
But you have to do something for me.

510
53:58.824 --> 53:59.825
What are you waiting for?

511
54:03.400 --> 54:05.101
I thought you were fucking dead.

512
54:06.351 --> 54:08.100
I massaged you so you could walk again.
